  "template": "<div lang=\"es\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/coleccion/emisiones-promocionales/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:64px 24px 96px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,58px); line-height:1.05; color:#d8d2cd; margin:0 0 24px;\">Scrip Promocional y Emisiones Efímeras</h1>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:clamp(18px,1.8vw,21px); line-height:1.7; color:#d8d2cd; max-width:680px; margin:0 0 56px;\">Moneda sustituta emitida fuera del sistema bancario &mdash;por cámaras de comercio, festejos locales o campañas promocionales&mdash; y pensada para circular brevemente antes de canjearse o coleccionarse como recuerdo.</p>\n\n    <section style=\"margin:0 0 80px; padding-top:48px; border-top:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.18);\">\n      <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#b7ab8a; margin-bottom:14px;\">Contexto Histórico</span>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px); line-height:1.15; color:#d8d2cd; margin:0 0 20px;\">El &ldquo;Scrip&rdquo; de la Gran Depresión</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.75; color:#d8d2cd; margin:0 0 14px;\">Durante la Gran Depresión de la década de 1930, la escasez de circulante llevó a cientos de municipios, cámaras de comercio y comerciantes estadounidenses a emitir su propio &ldquo;scrip&rdquo; &mdash;papel moneda sustituto, sin respaldo del gobierno federal, redimible en comercios locales o por la propia entidad emisora dentro de un plazo determinado.</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.75; color:#d8d2cd; margin:0;\">Un subgénero particular de este fenómeno es el <em>scrip conmemorativo o promocional</em>: emitido no por necesidad monetaria estricta, sino para celebrar un aniversario, festival o evento cívico, combinando la función de moneda temporal con la de recuerdo coleccionable. El scrip del 50º aniversario de Ringling Bros. en Baraboo, Wisconsin, es un ejemplo característico de esta categoría.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"ringling-bros-50-aniversario-baraboo\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px); color:#d8d2cd; margin:0 0 12px;\">50º Aniversario Ringling Bros. &mdash; Baraboo, Wisconsin</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.7; color:#b7ab8a; max-width:640px; margin:0 0 32px;\">Cámara de Comercio de Baraboo, Wisconsin &middot; Golden Jubilee, 1933 &middot; serie de 5&cent;, 10&cent;, 15&cent; y $1.</p>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 320px)); gap:28px;\">\n        <dc-import name=\"BanknoteCard\"\n          image=\"uploads/ringling-bros-50th-anniversary-baraboo-5-cents.jpg\"\n          image-webp=\"uploads/ringling-bros-50th-anniversary-baraboo-5-cents-640.webp\"\n          alt=\"Scrip del 50º aniversario de Ringling Bros., Baraboo, Wisconsin, cinco centavos, anverso, 1933\"\n          title=\"Ringling Bros. Golden Jubilee\"\n          denomination=\"5&cent;\"\n          year=\"1933\"\n          href=\"/coleccion/ringling-bros-50-aniversario-baraboo/#5-centavos\"\n          hint-size=\"320px,300px\"\n        ></dc-import>\n        <dc-import name=\"BanknoteCard\"\n          image=\"uploads/ringling-bros-50th-anniversary-baraboo-10-cents.jpg\"\n          image-webp=\"uploads/ringling-bros-50th-anniversary-baraboo-10-cents-640.webp\"\n          alt=\"Scrip del 50º aniversario de Ringling Bros., Baraboo, Wisconsin, diez centavos, anverso, 1933\"\n          title=\"Ringling Bros. Golden Jubilee\"\n          denomination=\"10&cent;\"\n          year=\"1933\"\n          href=\"/coleccion/ringling-bros-50-aniversario-baraboo/#10-centavos\"\n          hint-size=\"320px,300px\"\n        ></dc-import>\n        <dc-import name=\"BanknoteCard\"\n          image=\"uploads/ringling-bros-50th-anniversary-baraboo-15-cents.jpg\"\n          image-webp=\"uploads/ringling-bros-50th-anniversary-baraboo-15-cents-640.webp\"\n          alt=\"Scrip del 50º aniversario de Ringling Bros., Baraboo, Wisconsin, quince centavos, anverso y reverso, 1933\"\n          title=\"Ringling Bros. Golden Jubilee\"\n          denomination=\"15&cent;\"\n          year=\"1933\"\n          href=\"/coleccion/ringling-bros-50-aniversario-baraboo/#15-centavos\"\n          hint-size=\"320px,300px\"\n        ></dc-import>\n        <dc-import name=\"BanknoteCard\"\n          image=\"uploads/ringling-bros-50th-anniversary-baraboo-1-dollar-card.jpg\"\n          image-webp=\"uploads/ringling-bros-50th-anniversary-baraboo-1-dollar-card.webp\"\n          alt=\"Scrip del 50º aniversario de Ringling Bros., Baraboo, Wisconsin, un dólar, anverso y reverso, 1933\"\n          title=\"Ringling Bros. Golden Jubilee\"\n          denomination=\"$1\"\n          year=\"1933\"\n          href=\"/coleccion/ringling-bros-50-aniversario-baraboo/#1-dolar\"\n          hint-size=\"320px,300px\"\n        ></dc-import>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"food-coupons\" style=\"margin-top:72px; padding-top:48px; border-top:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.18);\">\n      <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#b7ab8a; margin-bottom:14px;\">Escrip Fiscal Federal</span>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px); color:#d8d2cd; margin:0 0 12px;\">Food Coupons, Departamento de Agricultura de EE. UU.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.7; color:#b7ab8a; max-width:640px; margin:0 0 32px;\">Programa federal de Cupones de Alimentos &middot; series 1980-B y 2000-B &middot; vales no transferibles impresos como billetes.</p>\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 320px)); gap:28px;\">\n        <dc-import name=\"BanknoteCard\"\n          image=\"uploads/usda-food-coupon-1-dollar-1980-serie-b.jpg\"\n          image-webp=\"uploads/usda-food-coupon-1-dollar-1980-serie-b.webp\"\n          alt=\"Cupón de alimentos de un dólar del Departamento de Agricultura de EE. UU., serie 1980-B, anverso y reverso\"\n          title=\"Food Coupon USDA\"\n          denomination=\"1 Dólar\"\n          year=\"1980\"\n          href=\"/coleccion/emisiones-promocionales/food-coupon-1-dolar-1980/\"\n          hint-size=\"320px,300px\"\n        ></dc-import>\n        <dc-import name=\"BanknoteCard\"\n          image=\"uploads/usda-food-coupon-5-dollars-2000-serie-b-card.jpg\"\n          image-webp=\"uploads/usda-food-coupon-5-dollars-2000-serie-b-card.webp\"\n          alt=\"Cupón de alimentos USDA de cinco dólares, Serie 2000-B\"\n          title=\"Food Coupon USDA\"\n          denomination=\"$5\"\n          year=\"2000-B\"\n          href=\"/coleccion/emisiones-promocionales/food-coupons-serie-2000-b/\"\n          hint-size=\"320px,300px\"\n        ></dc-import>\n        <dc-import name=\"BanknoteCard\"\n          image=\"uploads/usda-food-coupon-10-dollars-2000-serie-b-card.jpg\"\n          image-webp=\"uploads/usda-food-coupon-10-dollars-2000-serie-b-card.webp\"\n          alt=\"Cupón de alimentos USDA de diez dólares, Serie 2000-B\"\n          title=\"Food Coupon USDA\"\n          denomination=\"$10\"\n          year=\"2000-B\"\n          href=\"/coleccion/emisiones-promocionales/food-coupons-serie-2000-b/\"\n          hint-size=\"320px,300px\"\n        ></dc-import>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
